# Flutter / Dart

- **Versions:** Flutter 3.44.0, Dart 3.10+; run `flutter pub get` after dependency changes
- **Style:** `const` constructors, `StatelessWidget` by default, Material 3
- **Theme:** Preserve starter palette — scaffold `0xFF0C0D12`, emerald accent gradient (`0xFF10B981` → `0xFF059669`), muted text `0xFFA1A1AA`
- **State management:** Provider (chosen; do not introduce Riverpod or Bloc)

## Suggested folder growth (flexible, not day-1 mandatory)

```text
lib/
  main.dart
  app.dart              # MaterialApp / theme (when main grows)
  features/<name>/      # screens + widgets per feature
  shared/               # reusable widgets, theme extensions
  data/                 # repositories, API clients (only when backend exists)
```

## Web-first (WSL2)

- Avoid mobile-only plugins unless they support web
- Run Flutter only inside WSL2; dev server: `flutter run -d web-server --web-port=3000 --web-hostname=0.0.0.0` (reachable at `http://localhost:3000` from Windows)
- Use `flutter run -d chrome` only when Chrome is available inside WSL
- Run `flutter analyze` before large UI rewrites
- Widget tests only when they cover real behavior; skip trivial assertions
